<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NetComm year net profit A$1.75 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-NetComm year net profit A$1.75 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>		  (A$ million unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 profit 1.55 vs loss 0.04</p>
<p>    Net				 profit 1.75 vs loss 0.97</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		  1.5 vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				     47.53 vs 33.32</p>
<p>    Other income			     0.78 vs 0.78</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     profit 11.0 vs loss 7.6</p>
<p>    Abnormal			  profit 0.20 vs loss 0.75</p>
<p>    Tax					   nil vs credit 0.19</p>
<p>    Interest				   0.20 vs 0.17</p>
<p>    Depreciation			     0.98 vs 0.75</p>
<p>    Minorities				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE-NetComm Ltd is a modem manufacturer and distributor.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
